  "notes": "FORMS:\n⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧ (to hear) + ⟦{慣|な}れる→慣れる：00870_nareru⟧ (to become accustomed) → to become accustomed to hearing\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\nOften used in the negative form {聞|き}き{慣|な}れない to describe unfamiliar sounds or expressions.\n\nRELATED COMPOUND VERBS:\n- ⟦{食|た}べ{慣|な}れる→食べ慣れる：08505_tabenareru⟧ (to become used to eating)\n- ⟦{見|み}{慣|な}れる→見慣れる：07953_minareru⟧ (to become used to seeing)\n- ⟦{住|す}み{慣|な}れる→住み慣れる：08506_suminareru⟧ (to become used to living)\n- ⟦{使|つか}い{慣|な}れる→使い慣れる：07877_tsukainareru⟧ (to become used to using)",
